***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** ArgoCD repository SSH credentials. ArgoCD uses this to pull the (private)
***REMOVED*** GitOps repo over SSH. Copy to `argocd-ssh-creds.yaml`, fill in, and let ArgoCD
***REMOVED*** manage it (it IS GitOps-managed, unlike some other bootstrap secrets).
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED***   cp argocd-ssh-creds.yaml.example argocd-ssh-creds.yaml
***REMOVED***   $EDITOR argocd-ssh-creds.yaml
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED*** `url` is the SSH clone URL of your repo (ssh://git@github.com/OWNER/REPO.git).
***REMOVED*** `sshPrivateKey` is the private half of a GitHub deploy key with read access;
***REMOVED*** paste the full PEM (-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY----- ... -----END ...-----).
***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
    name: k8s-repo-ssh-creds
    namespace: argo-system
    labels:
        argocd.argoproj.io/secret-type: repository
stringData:
    url: ssh://git@github.com/REPLACE_OWNER/REPLACE_REPO.git
    sshPrivateKey: |
        -----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----
        REPLACE_WITH_DEPLOY_KEY_PRIVATE_KEY
        -----END OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----
